1
00:00:04,575 --> 00:00:06,158
Definitely a curse womb.

2
00:00:06,241 --> 00:00:09,325
Our window verified that
about three hours ago.

3
00:00:09,408 --> 00:00:12,700
Once 90% were evacuated,

4
00:00:12,783 --> 00:00:15,241
the decision was made
to seal off the center.

5
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:18,533
All citizens within
a 500 meter radius

6
00:00:18,616 --> 00:00:20,241
have been evacuated as well.

7
00:00:21,616 --> 00:00:22,616
I have a question.

8
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,199
What is this window?

9
00:00:24,283 --> 00:00:26,700
It's an in-house term

10
00:00:26,783 --> 00:00:30,158
for unique members of
Jujutsu Tech who can see curses

11
00:00:30,241 --> 00:00:31,325
but they aren't sorcerers.

12
00:00:31,408 --> 00:00:33,908
[Yuuji] Oh, okay.

13
00:00:33,992 --> 00:00:35,075
Let's continue.

14
00:00:35,158 --> 00:00:37,867
Detainee block two.

15
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,908
At present, five
detainees are still inside

16
00:00:40,992 --> 00:00:42,408
along with the curse womb.

17
00:00:43,992 --> 00:00:46,908
If the curse womb is the
type that metamorphose,

18
00:00:46,992 --> 00:00:50,199
we predict it will become
a special grade curse spirit.

19
00:00:50,283 --> 00:00:52,533
[Both] Special grade?

20
00:00:52,616 --> 00:00:55,283
Hey, so I still don't
really understand

21
00:00:55,366 --> 00:00:57,074
what this special grade means.

22
00:00:57,324 --> 00:01:01,198
All right, allow me
to explain it idiot level.

23
00:01:01,282 --> 00:01:05,574
First there's grade four, a
wooden bat is enough for them.

24
00:01:05,657 --> 00:01:08,240
Grade three, if you have a
handgun, you can rest easy.

25
00:01:08,324 --> 00:01:11,407
Grade two, close
call with a shotgun.

26
00:01:11,490 --> 00:01:13,907
Grade one, even a
tank may be insufficient.

27
00:01:13,991 --> 00:01:16,198
Then special grade, well,
you might be on even footing

28
00:01:16,282 --> 00:01:19,407
if you carpet bomb
it with cluster bombs.

29
00:01:19,490 --> 00:01:20,490
That is bad.

30
00:01:20,574 --> 00:01:23,407
Normally, a sorcerer on
par with the cursed spirit

31
00:01:23,490 --> 00:01:25,615
would handle this.

32
00:01:25,699 --> 00:01:28,324
And in this case, that
would have been Gojou.

33
00:01:28,407 --> 00:01:29,157
That figures.

34
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:32,574
So, where is Gojou then?

35
00:01:32,657 --> 00:01:34,574
[Megumi] Away on business.

36
00:01:34,657 --> 00:01:36,449
Guy like him has
better things to do

37
00:01:36,532 --> 00:01:39,449
than loaf around the
school in the first place.

38
00:01:39,532 --> 00:01:41,324
Don't expect any souvenirs.

39
00:01:41,407 --> 00:01:44,282
Unfortunately, we're often
short handed in this business.

40
00:01:45,365 --> 00:01:47,615
You'll often have to
undertake missions

41
00:01:47,699 --> 00:01:49,157
beyond your expertise.

42
00:01:50,407 --> 00:01:52,157
However, this current
case is an urgent one

43
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:54,574
and most of abnormal.

44
00:01:54,657 --> 00:01:56,782
So no matter what, don't fight.

45
00:01:56,866 --> 00:01:58,341
And if you should
encounter a special grade,

46
00:01:58,365 --> 00:02:01,615
you run or you die.

47
00:02:01,699 --> 00:02:02,449
(Nobara and Yuuji gasp)

48
00:02:02,532 --> 00:02:06,365
Please do not
disregard your fears.

49
00:02:06,449 --> 00:02:09,282
And don't forget that your
entire mission here today

50
00:02:09,365 --> 00:02:11,782
is strictly the verification
and rescue of survivors.

51
00:02:11,866 --> 00:02:13,657
Excuse me, sir, tell
me, where's my son?

52
00:02:13,741 --> 00:02:15,866
[Security] Stay back, ma'am,
you can't come in here.

53
00:02:15,949 --> 00:02:16,866
Move back, please.

54
00:02:16,949 --> 00:02:17,866
Where's Tadashi?

55
00:02:17,949 --> 00:02:20,574
I need to know if my
son Tadashi is all right.

56
00:02:20,657 --> 00:02:23,324
[Security] Please calm down
ma'am, you must stay back.

57
00:02:23,407 --> 00:02:24,198
-Please let me through.
-Its too dangerous.

58
00:02:24,282 --> 00:02:27,282
She's a guardian
here for a visit.

59
00:02:27,365 --> 00:02:29,033
Please leave, madam.

60
00:02:29,115 --> 00:02:32,115
It's possible that someone
may have released poisonous gas

61
00:02:32,198 --> 00:02:33,198
in the compound.

62
00:02:34,407 --> 00:02:36,341
I'm afraid we can't share
any more details at this time.

63
00:02:36,365 --> 00:02:42,324
Oh, no (crying)

64
00:02:42,407 --> 00:02:46,824
Why is this happening (crying)

65
00:02:47,449 --> 00:02:52,033
Fushiguro, Kugisaki,
we'll save them.

66
00:02:52,115 --> 00:02:52,532
Of course.

67
00:02:52,615 --> 00:02:55,323
(Megumi grunting)

68
00:02:55,406 --> 00:02:58,156
(Opening Theme Music)

69
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:17,531
(singing in Japanese)

70
00:04:27,573 --> 00:04:29,740
(footsteps clicking)

71
00:04:29,823 --> 00:04:30,823
Be careful.

72
00:04:33,032 --> 00:04:34,406
I'll put up my veil,

73
00:04:35,489 --> 00:04:37,781
emerge from
darkness blacker still

74
00:04:37,865 --> 00:04:39,573
purify that which is impure.

75
00:04:39,656 --> 00:04:43,114
(veil bubbling)

76
00:04:43,406 --> 00:04:44,448
Huh?

77
00:04:46,656 --> 00:04:48,613
Day's turning into night.

78
00:04:48,697 --> 00:04:49,447
That's part of the veil.

79
00:04:49,530 --> 00:04:51,488
Since there's a
residential area nearby,

80
00:04:51,572 --> 00:04:55,031
we use it to conceal us
from those on the outside.

81
00:04:55,113 --> 00:04:56,280
Awesome.

82
00:04:56,363 --> 00:04:57,363
Moron

83
00:04:58,864 --> 00:05:01,947
-Demon dogs.
-(Dog bubbling)

84
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,822
(Dog howling)

85
00:05:04,905 --> 00:05:07,155
He'll let us know if
the curse gets close.

86
00:05:08,363 --> 00:05:08,697
Good boy, buddy.

87
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:11,072
What a good boy.

88
00:05:11,155 --> 00:05:12,822
You know, we're
all counting on you.

89
00:05:12,905 --> 00:05:16,196
(door creaking)

90
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,322
Let's go

91
00:05:17,697 --> 00:05:20,822
(footsteps clicking)

92
00:05:20,905 --> 00:05:21,947
Hold up.

93
00:05:23,447 --> 00:05:26,322
(gasping) what the hell is this?

94
00:05:27,905 --> 00:05:29,072
What's going on here?

95
00:05:29,155 --> 00:05:33,322
I thought this was only a two
story dorm building, isn't it?

96
00:05:33,405 --> 00:05:35,697
Well, maybe it's
a condo, chill out.

97
00:05:35,780 --> 00:05:38,113
[Megumi] No, it's not.

98
00:05:38,196 --> 00:05:39,864
It's the deployment
of an innate domain

99
00:05:39,947 --> 00:05:43,363
due to cursed energy, I've
never seen one this big before.

100
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,780
The door.

101
00:05:46,905 --> 00:05:48,196
Hey, it's gone.

102
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,363
Impossible.

103
00:05:49,447 --> 00:05:52,196
No way, we just came
through that door a second ago.

104
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,989
[Both] What do we
do, what do we do,

105
00:05:54,072 --> 00:05:55,872
-its a major problem.
-[Megumi] We'll be fine.

106
00:05:55,947 --> 00:05:58,488
The dog remembers
the scent of the entrance.

107
00:05:58,572 --> 00:05:59,488
[Both] Oh, good.

108
00:05:59,572 --> 00:06:00,631
-Good dog, good dog
boy -Good boy, good boy.

109
00:06:00,655 --> 00:06:03,530
-Whose a good boy, huh,
-Now you can have all the

110
00:06:03,613 --> 00:06:05,089
-Oh that's right,
-beef jerky you want.

111
00:06:05,113 --> 00:06:07,113
- (laughing)
-Stop playing around.

112
00:06:07,196 --> 00:06:09,072
You rock Fushiguro,
you're such a pro.

113
00:06:09,155 --> 00:06:12,488
Thanks to you, we can rescue
some people and save ourselves.

114
00:06:15,989 --> 00:06:17,031
Let's keep moving.

115
00:06:19,155 --> 00:06:21,530
(eerie music)

116
00:06:48,779 --> 00:06:49,446
Horrible.

117
00:06:49,529 --> 00:06:53,154
Looks like three victims, right?

118
00:06:58,487 --> 00:06:59,487
[Mother] Where's Tadashi,

119
00:06:59,529 --> 00:07:02,404
I need to know if my
son, Tadashi, is all right.

120
00:07:03,030 --> 00:07:05,071
Let's take this
body back with us,

121
00:07:05,988 --> 00:07:08,279
this is that woman's son.

122
00:07:08,362 --> 00:07:09,362
But.

123
00:07:09,404 --> 00:07:11,112
His face isn't too mangled.

124
00:07:11,195 --> 00:07:12,571
How will she accept his death,

125
00:07:12,654 --> 00:07:15,195
if we can't show her
a body to prove it?

126
00:07:16,195 --> 00:07:18,112
(clothes shuffling)

127
00:07:18,195 --> 00:07:20,571
We still have to find
and verify two more,

128
00:07:20,654 --> 00:07:21,487
leave that body behind.

129
00:07:21,571 --> 00:07:23,571
That makes no sense,

130
00:07:23,654 --> 00:07:25,779
the way we got inside
isn't even there anymore,

131
00:07:25,863 --> 00:07:28,279
we won't be able to
come back for it later.

132
00:07:28,362 --> 00:07:30,487
I didn't say we'd come
back, I said, leave it behind.

133
00:07:30,571 --> 00:07:33,779
I'm not about to risk
my own life for someone

134
00:07:33,863 --> 00:07:36,404
I had no intention of
saving in the first place,

135
00:07:36,487 --> 00:07:37,571
so forget it.

136
00:07:37,654 --> 00:07:39,654
You had no intention
of saving him?

137
00:07:39,738 --> 00:07:42,154
Are you kidding?

138
00:07:42,237 --> 00:07:43,946
It's a juvy detention center

139
00:07:44,030 --> 00:07:45,446
and as a Jujutsu sorcerer,

140
00:07:45,529 --> 00:07:47,209
I had access to
information about this guy.

141
00:07:48,946 --> 00:07:50,154
Tadashi here, hit and killed

142
00:07:50,237 --> 00:07:52,321
a little girl on her
way home from school

143
00:07:52,404 --> 00:07:54,071
while driving without a license.

144
00:07:54,696 --> 00:07:57,612
And that was his second offense.

145
00:07:58,738 --> 00:08:01,654
I know you're keen on this
idea of saving lots of people

146
00:08:01,738 --> 00:08:04,487
and guiding them
to proper deaths,

147
00:08:05,237 --> 00:08:06,988
but think how are
you going to feel

148
00:08:07,071 --> 00:08:10,030
when someone you save goes
on to kill someone else later.

149
00:08:10,612 --> 00:08:13,696
So why'd you bother
saving me then?

150
00:08:14,863 --> 00:08:17,654
You both need to cut it
out (groans in frustration)

151
00:08:17,738 --> 00:08:20,988
What the hell is wrong
with the two of you?

152
00:08:21,071 --> 00:08:22,279
Are you guys both idiots?

153
00:08:22,362 --> 00:08:24,863
This is hardly the time
and place to be acting like

154
00:08:24,946 --> 00:08:26,904
(Nobara splashing)

155
00:08:26,988 --> 00:08:29,030
Kugi.. saki?

156
00:08:29,112 --> 00:08:30,404
[Megumi] No, way,

157
00:08:30,487 --> 00:08:32,487
Demon dogs should
have sensed curse.

158
00:08:32,571 --> 00:08:34,946
(eerie music)

159
00:08:35,946 --> 00:08:36,696
Itadori!!

160
00:08:36,779 --> 00:08:38,654
Time to run.

161
00:08:38,738 --> 00:08:40,862
We'll find her
later, right now...

162
00:08:40,945 --> 00:08:44,361
(both gasping in shock)

163
00:08:46,903 --> 00:08:50,029
[Megumi] No
mistaking it, it's a special grade.

164
00:08:50,111 --> 00:08:50,903
I can't move.

165
00:08:50,987 --> 00:08:55,695
[Yuuji] Move,
move, move, move.

166
00:08:55,778 --> 00:08:58,945
[Grandpa] You're a strong
kid so try to help others.

167
00:09:01,570 --> 00:09:04,320
(sword clanging)

168
00:09:07,611 --> 00:09:09,778
(hand thudding)

169
00:09:09,862 --> 00:09:13,903
Ita... dori...

170
00:09:13,987 --> 00:09:15,236
(gasping in shock)

171
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:19,070
(footsteps clicking)

172
00:09:19,153 --> 00:09:20,153
Where am I?

173
00:09:20,236 --> 00:09:24,194
It's so dark, I can't see
a damn thing in here.

174
00:09:25,611 --> 00:09:26,778
(chilling tune)

175
00:09:26,862 --> 00:09:27,945
The curse's presence.

176
00:09:29,486 --> 00:09:30,778
How can there be so many?

177
00:09:31,778 --> 00:09:35,361
(air whooshing)

178
00:09:35,695 --> 00:09:36,737
Nue.

179
00:09:39,111 --> 00:09:41,903
(wings whooshing)

180
00:09:43,820 --> 00:09:46,653
(feet thudding)

181
00:09:48,194 --> 00:09:49,778
[Megumi]
Itadori and Kugisaki,

182
00:09:49,862 --> 00:09:51,153
don't you die on me.

183
00:09:52,361 --> 00:09:52,987
[Yuuji]
I can't run away,

184
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:54,820
not when I've gotten this close.

185
00:09:57,153 --> 00:10:00,278
Hey Sukuna, if I die here
then you die too, right?

186
00:10:00,361 --> 00:10:01,987
So you have to help me out.

187
00:10:02,070 --> 00:10:03,820
[Sukuna] Not true.

188
00:10:03,903 --> 00:10:06,361
Even if the part of me
that's inside, you dies.

189
00:10:06,445 --> 00:10:08,778
There are 18 other fragments
of my soul still out there,

190
00:10:10,653 --> 00:10:12,320
still irritatingly enough,

191
00:10:12,403 --> 00:10:13,838
I don't yet have
control of this body.

192
00:10:13,862 --> 00:10:18,278
So if you want to switch,
go ahead and switch.

193
00:10:18,361 --> 00:10:21,320
But once you do, I'll
kill this punk sorcerer

194
00:10:21,403 --> 00:10:23,236
before the curse spirit can.

195
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:26,945
And then I'll do the
woman, she's a lively one,

196
00:10:27,029 --> 00:10:29,653
I'll have some fun with her.

197
00:10:29,737 --> 00:10:31,320
I'm not gonna let you do that.

198
00:10:31,403 --> 00:10:33,611
[Sukuna] Is that right?

199
00:10:33,695 --> 00:10:35,486
But if you get all focused on me

200
00:10:35,569 --> 00:10:37,902
then your friends are gonna die.

201
00:10:37,986 --> 00:10:38,819
(curse inhaling deeply)

202
00:10:38,902 --> 00:10:42,610
(ground rumbling)

203
00:10:45,235 --> 00:10:46,355
[Megumi] That's not Jujutsu,

204
00:10:47,861 --> 00:10:49,694
he just unleashed
pure cursed energy.

205
00:10:49,777 --> 00:10:53,485
(curse laughing)

206
00:10:54,235 --> 00:10:57,069
Fushiguro, Fushiguro, Fushiguro.

207
00:10:59,402 --> 00:11:01,610
Find Kugisaki and
get her out of here.

208
00:11:01,694 --> 00:11:03,485
I'll stay here and
keep this one busy,

209
00:11:03,569 --> 00:11:05,777
at least until
you two are clear.

210
00:11:05,861 --> 00:11:08,021
As soon as you're both out,
give me some kind of signal

211
00:11:08,069 --> 00:11:13,028
and then I'll switch
bodies with Sukuna.

212
00:11:13,110 --> 00:11:13,861
[Megumi] You'll
never stand a chance.

213
00:11:13,944 --> 00:11:16,736
Finding that thing
with one hand?

214
00:11:16,819 --> 00:11:21,193
Look closer, the
curse is having fun.

215
00:11:21,277 --> 00:11:23,569
It's obviously toying with us.

216
00:11:23,652 --> 00:11:24,986
At least I can buy us some time.

217
00:11:25,069 --> 00:11:26,902
You can't.

218
00:11:26,986 --> 00:11:31,819
Kushiguro, it's okay.

219
00:11:34,444 --> 00:11:37,694
-Demon dogs -(dog whooshing)

220
00:11:38,986 --> 00:11:40,110
Find Kugisaki.

221
00:11:42,028 --> 00:11:44,152
(curses laughing)

222
00:11:44,235 --> 00:11:45,861
Down to my last one already.

223
00:11:48,110 --> 00:11:48,902
I guess I should have brought

224
00:11:48,986 --> 00:11:51,319
a few more of
them along with me.

225
00:11:54,485 --> 00:11:56,569
(clothes ripping)

226
00:11:56,652 --> 00:11:59,319
(curse laughing)

227
00:12:00,777 --> 00:12:02,617
Guess you're saying it's
easier to move around,

228
00:12:02,652 --> 00:12:04,694
stripped down to your underwear.

229
00:12:04,777 --> 00:12:06,569
[Yuuji] What
am I supposed to do?

230
00:12:06,652 --> 00:12:08,986
I have no idea how
to use cursed energy.

231
00:12:09,069 --> 00:12:09,944
For now, that's fine.

232
00:12:10,028 --> 00:12:10,861
I just have to buy some time.

233
00:12:10,944 --> 00:12:14,736
(power whooshing)

234
00:12:18,319 --> 00:12:18,819
What the hell was that?

235
00:12:18,902 --> 00:12:20,777
A cursed energy barrier?

236
00:12:20,861 --> 00:12:23,028
(high frequency vibration)

237
00:12:23,110 --> 00:12:27,235
(ground rumbling)

238
00:12:27,319 --> 00:12:30,444
(groaning in pain)

239
00:12:30,527 --> 00:12:31,943
(heavy thuds)

240
00:12:32,027 --> 00:12:35,027
(suspenseful music)

241
00:12:43,151 --> 00:12:44,985
(light zapping)

242
00:12:50,027 --> 00:12:52,735
(ground rumbling)

243
00:12:52,818 --> 00:12:55,401
(power zapping)

244
00:12:56,151 --> 00:12:58,985
(groaning in pain)

245
00:12:59,985 --> 00:13:03,609
Ow, Ow, Ow.

246
00:13:03,693 --> 00:13:05,443
It hurts, it hurts, it hurts.

247
00:13:05,526 --> 00:13:06,860
Why am I doing this?

248
00:13:06,943 --> 00:13:10,192
If only I hadn't picked
up that finger back then.

249
00:13:12,234 --> 00:13:14,651
If only I hadn't eaten it.

250
00:13:14,735 --> 00:13:16,027
If only, if only.

251
00:13:17,609 --> 00:13:19,443
Stop it, don't think.

252
00:13:21,109 --> 00:13:24,985
No, no, I wanna run, I
wanna run, I wanna run.

253
00:13:25,068 --> 00:13:26,068
I don't wanna die.

254
00:13:28,985 --> 00:13:32,151
If I died here,
if I actually died,

255
00:13:32,234 --> 00:13:34,151
would that be a proper death?

256
00:13:35,401 --> 00:13:38,651
(light zapping)

257
00:13:38,735 --> 00:13:39,776
Don't think.

258
00:13:42,943 --> 00:13:45,526
[Grandpa] So,
try to help others.

259
00:13:45,609 --> 00:13:47,484
(ground booming)

260
00:13:47,568 --> 00:13:50,818
Have I, have I gotten so weak?

261
00:13:54,443 --> 00:13:57,359
You, I know your face now.

262
00:13:57,443 --> 00:13:59,443
I swear, I'm going to curse you.

263
00:14:00,234 --> 00:14:02,985
(curse groaning)

264
00:14:12,901 --> 00:14:13,818
(frog croaking)

265
00:14:13,901 --> 00:14:15,526
We're out here now, let's go.

266
00:14:15,609 --> 00:14:17,027
You know, I really hate frogs.

267
00:14:17,109 --> 00:14:19,693
Well, that's too damn bad.

268
00:14:27,026 --> 00:14:31,650
I was so proud, I thought
I was really strong.

269
00:14:32,775 --> 00:14:34,567
At least strong enough
that I could choose

270
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:38,442
when and how I die, but I'm not.

271
00:14:40,026 --> 00:14:41,233
I'm weak.

272
00:14:41,317 --> 00:14:42,317
I'm way too weak.

273
00:14:45,108 --> 00:14:50,108
I don't wanna die
but I am gonna die.

274
00:14:51,026 --> 00:14:53,233
No way, not like this.

275
00:14:53,317 --> 00:14:56,358
No (sobbing)

276
00:14:56,442 --> 00:14:58,191
Not like this (sobbing)

277
00:14:58,275 --> 00:14:59,734
[Yuuji]
A proper death,

278
00:15:00,650 --> 00:15:02,108
yeah, right, don't be naive.

279
00:15:04,442 --> 00:15:06,942
[Man] Jujutsu sorceress
never die without regret.

280
00:15:08,942 --> 00:15:10,233
[Yuuji] Still,

281
00:15:10,317 --> 00:15:13,734
I wanna be able to say
my death was a proper one.

282
00:15:14,942 --> 00:15:16,459
[Man] These negative
emotions of mankind

283
00:15:16,483 --> 00:15:18,067
become a source of curses.

284
00:15:19,525 --> 00:15:22,525
[Yuuji] So,
all the hate, the fear,

285
00:15:24,317 --> 00:15:29,067
the regret, let it all out

286
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:31,275
-and put it in your fist.
-(fire crackling)

287
00:15:31,358 --> 00:15:32,108
(curse laughing)

288
00:15:32,191 --> 00:15:35,900
(soothing music)

289
00:15:44,358 --> 00:15:45,775
Damn, nothing.

290
00:15:47,233 --> 00:15:50,275
(dog howling)

291
00:15:50,358 --> 00:15:51,108
[Yuuji] The howl.

292
00:15:51,191 --> 00:15:54,567
(dog howling)

293
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,817
[Yuuji] That must
be the signal from Kushiguro.

294
00:15:59,900 --> 00:16:02,608
(face whooshing)

295
00:16:06,817 --> 00:16:09,525
[Sukuna] Incredible,
what a pain this brat is.

296
00:16:10,358 --> 00:16:13,817
(upbeat music)

297
00:16:24,025 --> 00:16:26,066
Incredible, what
a pain this brat is.

298
00:16:26,149 --> 00:16:29,816
It's obvious he's just
screwing around with me.

299
00:16:32,733 --> 00:16:35,190
Hold on a minute,
I'm thinking here.

300
00:16:35,274 --> 00:16:37,691
What I need, is some
way to make him regret

301
00:16:37,774 --> 00:16:38,774
doing all of this.

302
00:16:40,399 --> 00:16:42,691
[Sukuna]
Nah, if I went after him,

303
00:16:42,774 --> 00:16:45,482
the punk would
just switch right back.

304
00:16:45,566 --> 00:16:48,357
So the thing that would
cause him the most trouble,

305
00:16:48,441 --> 00:16:51,357
is probably this.

306
00:16:51,441 --> 00:16:53,774
I'll just put things
back the way they were.

307
00:16:54,941 --> 00:16:56,566
All right, let's
go kill some kids.

308
00:16:57,399 --> 00:16:59,607
Follow me.

309
00:17:00,774 --> 00:17:03,357
(curse roaring)

310
00:17:06,232 --> 00:17:07,232
Idiot.

311
00:17:15,232 --> 00:17:18,858
Oh, shit I healed
his other hand too.

312
00:17:18,941 --> 00:17:19,733
(curse gasping in shock)

313
00:17:19,816 --> 00:17:22,524
What, you don't
like to take walks?

314
00:17:22,607 --> 00:17:23,733
Well, that's true.

315
00:17:23,816 --> 00:17:25,566
Cursed spirits are
usually supposed to stay

316
00:17:25,649 --> 00:17:26,733
where they're born.

317
00:17:26,816 --> 00:17:29,899
Fine, fine, in that case,

318
00:17:29,983 --> 00:17:31,816
you will die here.

319
00:17:31,899 --> 00:17:35,566
(curse groaning in pain)

320
00:17:35,649 --> 00:17:37,399
Hey, what's the matter.

321
00:17:37,482 --> 00:17:39,774
You're not finished
already, are you?

322
00:17:39,858 --> 00:17:42,025
(groaning in effort)

323
00:17:42,107 --> 00:17:46,566
Yeah good, that's the
way, just try a little harder.

324
00:17:46,649 --> 00:17:49,482
(ground rumbling)

325
00:17:51,983 --> 00:17:54,733
(air whooshing)

326
00:17:54,816 --> 00:17:58,607
Even a cursed spirit is
bound to miss his arm.

327
00:17:59,607 --> 00:18:00,524
(teeth gnashing)

328
00:18:00,607 --> 00:18:03,399
(Sukuna laughing)

329
00:18:07,691 --> 00:18:10,524
(water splashing)

330
00:18:15,316 --> 00:18:17,607
[Megumi] You need to
expand the evacuation area

331
00:18:17,691 --> 00:18:18,274
to 10 kilometers.

332
00:18:18,356 --> 00:18:20,773
[Kitoyaka] What about you?

333
00:18:20,857 --> 00:18:23,773
I'll stay, I'm going
to wait for Itadori.

334
00:18:23,857 --> 00:18:25,148
Understood, all right,

335
00:18:25,231 --> 00:18:28,440
let me get Kugisaki
to the hospital.

336
00:18:28,523 --> 00:18:30,773
Then I'll come back here of you.

337
00:18:30,857 --> 00:18:34,065
No, you wouldn't be of that
much use in this situation.

338
00:18:35,315 --> 00:18:38,065
To really help, you could
have them send us a sorcerer

339
00:18:38,148 --> 00:18:39,440
whose grade one or higher.

340
00:18:40,231 --> 00:18:42,231
If one was around.

341
00:18:42,315 --> 00:18:44,440
I'll do my best, later.

342
00:18:52,273 --> 00:18:54,815
[Megumi]
Even if this goes south,

343
00:18:54,898 --> 00:18:56,315
if the worst case happens.

344
00:18:56,398 --> 00:18:58,606
I don't want him to die?

345
00:18:58,690 --> 00:19:01,481
Gojou, can you save him?

346
00:19:03,356 --> 00:19:05,940
It will be my
responsibility to end him.

347
00:19:08,315 --> 00:19:11,648
Hey, did you know about this?

348
00:19:11,732 --> 00:19:13,481
Surprisingly, you and I both

349
00:19:13,565 --> 00:19:16,481
are apparently classified
as special grade.

350
00:19:16,565 --> 00:19:19,273
Good job, you and me, man.

351
00:19:25,273 --> 00:19:28,231
(curse bubbling)

352
00:19:32,565 --> 00:19:33,231
All right, special grade.

353
00:19:33,315 --> 00:19:35,940
You just keep trying.

354
00:19:38,398 --> 00:19:39,481
(curse laughing)

355
00:19:39,565 --> 00:19:41,898
Pleased with yourself?

356
00:19:41,982 --> 00:19:43,356
You want praise now?

357
00:19:44,773 --> 00:19:46,541
But healing with cursed
energy, isn't all that difficult.

358
00:19:46,565 --> 00:19:51,148
It's a lot easier for cursing
spirits than it is for humans.

359
00:19:52,315 --> 00:19:55,315
Neither you nor this
punk whose body I'm in,

360
00:19:55,398 --> 00:19:59,315
truly understand
what curses really are.

361
00:19:59,398 --> 00:20:01,481
This is a good opportunity.

362
00:20:01,565 --> 00:20:07,315
So I will use it to show you
exactly what real Jujutsu is.

363
00:20:10,648 --> 00:20:11,648
Domain expansion.

364
00:20:20,772 --> 00:20:24,272
-Malevolent shrine.
-(eerie music)

365
00:20:26,772 --> 00:20:28,314
(curse splattering)

366
00:20:28,397 --> 00:20:31,272
I was only planning
to slice you into three

367
00:20:31,355 --> 00:20:34,314
but I guess you were
weaker than I thought.

368
00:20:34,397 --> 00:20:38,564
Oh yeah and then there's this.

369
00:20:38,647 --> 00:20:39,647
I will be taking this.

370
00:20:44,272 --> 00:20:46,981
(fire whooshing)

371
00:20:50,647 --> 00:20:52,230
It's over you punk.

372
00:20:56,023 --> 00:20:56,939
What are you waiting for,

373
00:20:57,023 --> 00:20:58,663
if you're gonna switch
then do it already.

374
00:21:03,814 --> 00:21:06,314
Oh, oh, something wrong brat?

375
00:21:07,564 --> 00:21:09,897
(laughing)

376
00:21:13,314 --> 00:21:14,314
Well, well.

377
00:21:15,814 --> 00:21:17,522
(Closing Theme Music)

378
00:22:45,730 --> 00:22:48,022
(Nobara, Megumi
and Yuuji) Juju Stroll

379
00:22:48,104 --> 00:22:50,187
Yes, yes I understand.

380
00:22:50,271 --> 00:22:52,229
Yes, indeed, thank
you very much.

381
00:22:52,313 --> 00:22:53,354
Yes.

382
00:22:55,563 --> 00:22:56,855
What's the matter?

383
00:22:56,938 --> 00:22:58,497
You bow even when
you're talking on the phone?

384
00:22:58,521 --> 00:23:03,104
(laughing) Well,
when I'm on a call

385
00:23:03,187 --> 00:23:04,747
I get so wrapped up
in talking to that person

386
00:23:04,771 --> 00:23:06,563
that it feels like
they're really there.

387
00:23:06,646 --> 00:23:10,354
Oh, I get that, I've even
hurt my neck before,

388
00:23:10,438 --> 00:23:11,896
dealing with those
damn ingrown hairs

389
00:23:11,980 --> 00:23:13,563
while I was depilating,
what's worse,

390
00:23:13,646 --> 00:23:15,730
I've damaged my pores.

391
00:23:15,813 --> 00:23:16,956
That's not even
remotely the same.

392
00:23:16,980 --> 00:23:19,855
You always sound pissed
off when you're on the phone,

393
00:23:19,938 --> 00:23:21,063
Fushiguro.

394
00:23:21,146 --> 00:23:24,063
That's because of Gojou,
it's not because of the phone.

395
00:23:24,146 --> 00:23:27,688
Itadori, when you're on
the phone, you walk around.

396
00:23:27,771 --> 00:23:29,104
Speaking of phones,

397
00:23:29,187 --> 00:23:31,104
I bet you can't stay on a call

398
00:23:31,187 --> 00:23:32,980
while holding
your phone like this.

399
00:23:33,980 --> 00:23:35,896
(bell ringing)

400
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:38,396
(bell ringing)

401
00:23:38,479 --> 00:23:39,938
(Nobara gasping)

402
00:23:40,022 --> 00:23:44,980
-(Nobara screaming)
-(phone shattering)

403
00:23:45,063 --> 00:23:47,813
(upbeat music)

